# Thirty seconds where nothing lands, once every five minutes. The whole of it
# is damage_taken_pct at 1.00, which the fight takes off the hit itself rather
# than off a damage table -- see BuffOption::damage_taken_pct.
#
# GMS lets a Paladin end it early and take back cooldown for the seconds it
# gave up; nothing here would ever want to, the fight having no reason to drop
# an invincibility it is not paying for.
#
# Its own animation is 900ms, and GMS bars an invincibility skill from a skill
# sequence -- so this is one of the few casts that really would play it. It is
# charged the sequence's flat 120ms all the same: one cast every 300 seconds
# is not worth a way of saying so in the data.
name: "Sacrosanctity"
description:
  "Call upon the heavens to protect you from all attacks for a short time."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_PALADIN skill_order: 1 }
hyper: true
required_level: 140
max_level: 1
base_delay_ms: 120
cooldown_seconds: 300.0
buff {
  duration_seconds: 30.0
  base { damage_taken_pct: 1.00 }
}
